Z||000000||85ZainoGT||08-14-2001||10:58 PM||||w00000h000000~!!!  im happy! I was expecting HIGH 16's to mid 17's, as everyone else prolly was... well I went in my 85gt STOCK AS CAN BE, 4 speed manual, my first time at the track period.  ok, so here are the times, from first to third...<P><BR>FIRST RUN<BR>  R/T   1.229<BR>  60'   2.217<BR>  330   6.713<BR>  1/8   10.469<BR>  MPH   66.17<BR>  1000  .000??? lol<BR>  1/4   16.475  <BR>  MPH   79.14<P>SECOND RUN<BR>  R/T   .591***<BR>  60'   2.257<BR>  330   6.673<BR>  1/8   10.394<BR>  MPH   66.77***<BR>  1000  13.547***<BR>  1/4   16.276  <BR>  MPH   82.20<P>THIRD RUN<BR>  R/T   1.152<BR>  60'   2.153***<BR>  330   6.642***<BR>  1/8   10.367***<BR>  MPH   66.70<BR>  1000  .000(again)<BR>  1/4   16.196***<BR>  MPH   83.52***<P>  so how do you think I did for my first time at the track and it was in my 85gt bone stock...?||||reg||6
