Z||000005||85ZainoGT||08-15-2001||01:36 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by KissMySSFiero:<BR><B>what track did you go to?   where is plainfield, Indiana?  i live near gary in NW indiana.  <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I went to IRP in Speedway, IN... Plainfield is on the southwest side, more west then south...  but this weekend we are hoping to get a few fieros to g-wood and go cruisin, if your interested...||||reg||1
Z||000006||grinthock||08-15-2001||04:18 PM||||Well your 16.1 is pretty much inline with stock, my stock 85 4spd did 16.1 -- 16.2 until I did a couple EASY EASY THINGS!  First, port the exhaust to clear the restrictions($50 at a machine shop to get someone else to do it!), second, get a K&N, it makes a difference.  Also, lose the SUB BOX if you got one, the spare tire, jack and all that crap up front.... I got my fairly stock 85GT 4spd down to 15.6||||reg||1
